<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA V SRI LANKA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA V SRI LANKA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First day scoreboard of the first</p>
<p>test between Sri Lanka and India in Colombo on Saturday:</p>
<p>India first innings</p>
<p> N.Mongia c Jayawardena b Pushpakumar     7</p>
<p> N.Sidhu c Kaluwitharana b Vaas	   111</p>
<p> R.Dravid c and b Jayasuriya		 69</p>
<p> S.Tendulkar not out			   65</p>
<p> M.Azharuddin not out			  18</p>
<p> Extras (nb-10)				  10</p>
<p> Total (for 3 wickets)			280 - close</p>
<p>To Bat: S.Ganguly, A.Kumble, R.Chauhan, V.Prasad,</p>
<p>N.Kulkarni, A.Kuruvilla.</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-36 2-183 3-230.</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): Vaas 17-5-55-1, Pushpakumar</p>
<p>14-1-64-1, Jayawardena 2-0-6-0, Muralitharan 31-7-79-0 (6nb),</p>
<p>Silva 15-0-56-0 (4nb), Jayasuriya 11-2-20-1.</p>
<p>Sri Lanka - Arjuna Ranatunga (captain), Sanath Jayasuriya,</p>
<p>Marvan Atapattu, Roshan Mahanama, Aravinda de Silva, Mahela</p>
<p>Jayawardena, Romesh Kaluwitharana, Chaminda Vaas, Ravindra</p>
<p>Pushpakumara, Muthiah Muralitharan, Jayantha Silva.</p>
